        "id": 181168,
        "name": "Fynikz",
        "username": "Fynikz",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/9e8a1a/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-08-17T14:10:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I got Santa Guise during this, I'm not sure EXACTLY what the conditions were. I had:</p><p>Legacy with Fortitude, Next Evolution, and Inspiring Presence.</p><p>Guise who had played Guise the Barbarian, Super Ultra Kawaii, and used Super Ultra Kawaii to play Selling Out! (yes, all of the card plays)</p><p>During Selling Out (One-shots), I used Gimmicky Character for an extra card play of any type and played \"Uh, yeah, I'm that guy!\" on Legacy before chaining Best Card Ever!s together. I'm not sure exactly when Santa Guise unlocked during that.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Given the text for the one-shot involves Guise specifically calling out grandpa Legacy and \"THAT card\", I imagune \"Uh, yeah, I'm that guy!\" on Legacy is a big part of it. Probably with either Inspiring Presence (Inspiring PRESENTS?) and/or Next Evolution (because Santa Guise in the next evolution of Guise.. harhar?)</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:05:51.794Z",
