        "id": 181169,
        "name": "Trajector",
        "username": "Trajector",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-08-17T14:50:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint and Santa Guise here, as well, with a relic win executed by damage. Holy crud there are a lot of off-turn combos with these three. Inspiring Presence + Uh, Yeah, I’m That Guy + Guise the Barbarian + Blatant Reference is just a bonkers way to deal damage.</p>\n<p>Something on an off-turn card play got me the Santa Guise promo. I don’t recall exactly, unfortunately.</p>\n<p>I have to say, when Guise high-fived Legacy and said “For liberty! Truth! And JUSTIN!” I laughed out loud. Also, his air guitar and, err, “vocalizing.”</p>",
