      {
        "id": 181170,
        "name": "jajd2c",
        "username": "jajd2c",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/a88e4f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-08-17T20:10:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint. As expected.</p><p>I started this game last night, but I was tired enough so that working my way through the combos was impossible. I closed the app, and decided to sleep before I tried it again. When I came back to the game, combos kept flying about so that I couldn't have kept them straight had the game been on the tabletop. As it was, I forgot whose turn I was on a few times. I am so much more suited to straight-up damage races....</p><p>Long story short, I beat down two relics and got rid of the third with Gimmicky Character. Gloomy still had 80 hp, Guise had 26, Legacy had 22, and the Adept had 8, since I had been ignoring the Sable Pin which was attached to him.</p><p>On a less stellar note, on the victory screen, Guise was nowhere to be seen, with just a brick wall and hp box to show where he should have been.</p>",
